Looking at the code, I need to convert the pointwise binary cross-entropy loss to a pairwise BPR (Bayesian Personalized Ranking) loss, grouped by user. The key changes are:

1. Group training data by user
2. Sample positive (high label) and negative (low label) item pairs per user  
3. Replace pointwise step() with pairwise BPR ranking loss (log-sigmoid of score difference)
4. Update gradients for both positive and negative items with opposite signs

